{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/extras/ModuleTypeShorter.gif?t=1746870344\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you're a cargo hauler navigating the deep space, fending off pirates while unravelling the mystery of how you ended up here... wherever here is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your ship to suit your needs with specialized builds, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel speed</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuel Rigs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turret Modifications</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resistances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mining</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/extras/PlaceModules.gif?t=1746870344\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage Module Placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize your placement of cargo and tailor your ship to suit your mission, whether it's maximizing hauling capacity or ensuring you're equipped to fend off potential threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Buy and Attach Wagons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your module capacity by upgrading to larger wagons, allowing you to carry even more cargo. With no limits on how many you can attach, you can create the ultimate Space Train/Truck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/extras/Explore.gif?t=1746870344\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel throughout the system to find Caves, Mazes, Pirate Camps, Lost Cargo, and more as you uncover the mysteries of this place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;You drift back to consciousness, your mind sluggish as a voice crackles through the comms, hailing your ship. The last thing you remember is darkness.... absolute, suffocating. And then\u2026 that sound. A shiver runs down your spine, snapping you further awake. That sound\u2026&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/extras/HighresScreenshot00000.png?t=1746870344\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613300?t=1746870344","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613300?t=1746870344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/4e8f2c3a8704a99de0b0e8eca1d05181bcfb2186/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746870344","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/4e8f2c3a8704a99de0b0e8eca1d05181bcfb2186/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746870344","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613300/extras/ModuleTypeShorter.gif?t=1746870344\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you're a cargo hauler navigating the deep space, fending off pirates while unravelling the mystery of how you ended up here... wherever here is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your ship to suit your needs with specialized builds, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel speed</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuel Rigs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turrets</p><